(corpus-ch4-092)
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic
    long=0 lat=0 alt=0 vel=0 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 wt=1
  *segment 1 test
    *fly alpha vrs tseg
      opta-1    0
      opta-2   20
      opta-3   40
      opta-4   60
      opta-5   80
      opta-6  100
      opta-7  opta-8

    *when tseg>opta-8 stop

*end
